{"title": "Fractured Complex", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:322px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:FracturedComplexMainEntrance.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"The main entrance of the Fractured Complex.\" src=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexMainEntrance.jpg/320px-FracturedComplexMainEntrance.jpg?f2a731\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexMainEntrance.jpg/480px-FracturedComplexMainEntrance.jpg?f2a731 1.5x, /images/thumb/FracturedComplexMainEntrance.jpg/640px-FracturedComplexMainEntrance.jpg?f2a731 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>  <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:FracturedComplexMainEntrance.jpg\" class=\"internal\" title=\"Enlarge\"></a></div>The main entrance of the Fractured Complex</div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Fractured Complex</b> is a factory-like interior with various machinery and conveyor belts. It most commonly spawns on <a href=\"/wiki/Empra\" title=\"Empra\">Empra</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Rooms\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Rooms</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Interior_Features\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Interior Features</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Secondary_Objectives\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Secondary Objectives</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Facility_Pressure\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Facility Pressure</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Facility_Power\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Facility Power</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Facility_Security\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Facility Security</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Rewards\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Rewards</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Event:_The_Compactor\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Event: The Compactor</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Rooms\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Rooms\">&gt; Rooms</span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Secure Door</b> - A large security door that spawns near the main entrance. This door can be opened by interacting with the lever next to it after completing a <a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#&gt;_Secondary_Objectives\"><b>Secondary Objective</b></a>.</li>\n<li><b>Break Room</b> - A room that can typically spawn near the main entrance that has lockers, cabinets, a refrigerator, etc. Scrap can spawn in this room and typically in the larger cabinet.</li>\n<li><b>Server Room</b> - A room with server racks, cabinets, and lockers. Scrap can spawn in this room, especially in the cabinets.</li>\n<li><b>Machinery Rooms</b> - Multiple different rooms with varying machinery in them. Scrap can spawn in in these rooms.</li>\n<li><b>Long Conveyor Belt</b> - A larger room with staircases and a long conveyor belt(s). Scrap frequently spawns in this room.</li>\n<li><b>Security Room</b> - A security office with several desks and monitors with a narrow hallway. This room is mostly for the <a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Facility_Security\"><b>Facility Security</b></a> objective.</li>\n<li><b>Catwalks</b> - Long, winding catwalks with numerous branching paths and doors. Scrap can spawn on small platforms near the railings or frequently in a part of this area that has a staircase and multiple cabinets.</li>\n<li><b>Apparatus</b> - A regular apparatus that is not guaranteed to spawn. If it does spawn, it will either be in its own room or in a large square area of the <b>Catwalks</b>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Interior_Features\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Interior_Features\">&gt; Interior Features</span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Sliding Doors</b> - Doors players can open and shut by interacting with the lever next to them. They can randomly slam shut when players approach them or walk through them and will open on their own after some time.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Secondary_Objectives\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Secondary_Objectives\">&gt; Secondary Objectives</span></h2>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:322px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:FracturedComplexSecureDoor.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexSecureDoor.jpg/320px-FracturedComplexSecureDoor.jpg?10e9b4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexSecureDoor.jpg/480px-FracturedComplexSecureDoor.jpg?10e9b4 1.5x, /images/thumb/FracturedComplexSecureDoor.jpg/640px-FracturedComplexSecureDoor.jpg?10e9b4 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>  <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:FracturedComplexSecureDoor.jpg\" class=\"internal\" title=\"Enlarge\"></a></div>The Secure Door that holds the reward.</div></div></div><p>One of three unique objectives will randomly generate for players to complete for one of three valuable rewards that will spawn past the <b>Secure Door</b>.\n</p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Facility_Pressure\">Facility Pressure</span></h3>\n<p>Players must find two sets of valves in the interior. A monitor displays the current pressure while a notice on the wall displays the target pressure. Players must add to or subtract from the current pressure by turning the valves left or right to reach the target pressure. Each valve can only be turned in a direction once before having to be turned the other way to return to its starting position. For example, if a player turns a valve to add 10, they can only turn the valve the other way to subtract 10 before being able to turn the valve to add 10 again. A sound effect will play after the target pressure is reached and the valves can not be interacted with anymore.\n</p><p>Once both sets of valves reach their target pressure, a sound effect will play and players can return to the <b>Secure Door</b> to get their reward.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Facility_Power\">Facility Power</span></h3>\n<p>Players must find two panels on the wall that have a 3x3 grid of buttons on it in the interior. Pressing one button will press all adjacent buttons and players must turn all the buttons green to turn on the power.\n</p><p>A sound effect will play if players are successful and the panel can no longer be interacted with. Once both panels have had all their buttons turned green, another sound effect will play and players can return to the <b>Secure Door</b> to get their reward.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Facility_Security\">Facility Security</span></h3>\n<p>Players must find their way to the <b>Security Room</b>. There are six live wires electrifying the floor and blocking the walkway, rapidly dealing 15 damage per hit to players. Players must get close enough to each wire to see the name tag on them or color of them and then return to a panel of 18 wires at the start of the room to cut that matching wire. Cutting a wrong wire will deal 90 damage to the player.\n</p><p>Once all six live wires have been cut, players can safely walk to the end of the room and press a button. A sound effect will play and players can return to the <b>Secure Door</b> to get their reward.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rewards\">Rewards</span></h3>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Fractured Complex Secondary Rewards\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Scrap Name</th>\n<th>Image</th>\n<th>Conductive</th>\n<th>Weight (lbs)</th>\n<th>Base Value</th>\n<th>Minimum Value</th>\n<th>Minimum Solo Value</th>\n<th>Maximum Value</th>\n<th>Maximum Solo Value\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Iron crucible</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Iron_crucible.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Iron crucible.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Iron_crucible.png/60px-Iron_crucible.png?b468b9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Iron_crucible.png/90px-Iron_crucible.png?b468b9 1.5x, /images/thumb/Iron_crucible.png/120px-Iron_crucible.png?b468b9 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>21</td>\n<td>160</td>\n<td>160</td>\n<td>187</td>\n<td>183</td>\n<td>214\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Silver crucible</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Silver_crucible.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Silver crucible.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Silver_crucible.png/60px-Silver_crucible.png?4d41fe\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Silver_crucible.png/90px-Silver_crucible.png?4d41fe 1.5x, /images/thumb/Silver_crucible.png/120px-Silver_crucible.png?4d41fe 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>21</td>\n<td>270</td>\n<td>270</td>\n<td>315</td>\n<td>310</td>\n<td>362\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Golden crucible</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Golden_crucible.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Golden crucible.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Golden_crucible.png/60px-Golden_crucible.png?6de91c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Golden_crucible.png/90px-Golden_crucible.png?6de91c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Golden_crucible.png/120px-Golden_crucible.png?6de91c 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>21</td>\n<td>420</td>\n<td>420</td>\n<td>491</td>\n<td>482</td>\n<td>563\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p>The reward is randomized, but the chance for a more valuable reward is increased by how early in the day players complete the objective and is influenced by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics#Furniture_luck\">the vanilla luck system</a>. The value of the reward is additionally increased by a difficulty multiplier, ranging from 0.6x to 1.4x, and a solo (singleplayer) multiplier of 1.17x. <b>Facility Power</b> is considered Easy difficulty and has a 1.0x multiplier while <b>Facility Pressure</b> and <b>Facility Security</b> are considered Medium difficulty and have a 1.15x multiplier. The base value and multipliers for objective rewards can be adjusted in the Wesleys Interior Tools config under the Secondary Objectives section.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Event:_The_Compactor\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Event:_The_Compactor\">&gt; Event: The Compactor</span></h2>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:322px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:FracturedComplexCompactor.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexCompactor.jpg/320px-FracturedComplexCompactor.jpg?cc60a0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexCompactor.jpg/480px-FracturedComplexCompactor.jpg?cc60a0 1.5x, /images/thumb/FracturedComplexCompactor.jpg/640px-FracturedComplexCompactor.jpg?cc60a0 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>  <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:FracturedComplexCompactor.jpg\" class=\"internal\" title=\"Enlarge\"></a></div>A sideview of The Compactor.</div></div></div><p><b>The Compactor</b> can randomly spawn within the interior. It spawns 16 Silver sheets inside of it that are conductive, weigh 26lbs, and range from \u25ae20 to \u25ae107 each.  As soon as a player enters <b>The Compactor</b>, its roof will begin to shut and a panel will be lowered to reveal five grids of buttons. Pressing one button will press all adjacent buttons in that grid. Players must turn all the buttons green to open the exit door.\n</p><p>Gears on the wall will have a Silver sheet already stuck in them. This sheet will break after roughly 14 seconds as soon as players drop in, causing <b>The Compactor</b> to begin advancing forward. Players must insert another Silver sheet into the gears to halt its advance for roughly another 24 seconds before that sheet breaks too. Players must repeatedly sacrifice Silver sheets to stall <b>The Compactor</b> while solving the grid puzzles to open the exit door and escape before it crushes them.\n</p><p>It is recommended that players quickly scan for lower value sheets and either hold them in their inventory or place them near the gears to pick up and insert as needed. It is also recommended to move Silver sheets closer to the exit, as they can not be collected through normal means once <b>The Compactor</b> moves over top of them.\n</p><p>Any Silver sheets that players can successfully get out of <b>The Compactor</b> is their reward for the event. This can range anywhere from \u25ae0 to \u25ae1752 depending on both how lucky and skillful players are. The average total for all 16 Silver sheets spawned is \u25ae1016.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:FracturedComplexBreak.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Break Room.\"><img alt=\"The Break Room.\" src=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexBreak.jpg/120px-FracturedComplexBreak.jpg?af6cc6\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexBreak.jpg/180px-FracturedComplexBreak.jpg?af6cc6 1.5x, /images/thumb/FracturedComplexBreak.jpg/240px-FracturedComplexBreak.jpg?af6cc6 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Break Room.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:FracturedComplexServers.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Server Room.\"><img alt=\"The Server Room.\" src=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexServers.jpg/120px-FracturedComplexServers.jpg?58fc6f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexServers.jpg/180px-FracturedComplexServers.jpg?58fc6f 1.5x, /images/thumb/FracturedComplexServers.jpg/240px-FracturedComplexServers.jpg?58fc6f 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Server Room.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:FracturedComplexMachinery.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A room with machinery in it.\"><img alt=\"A room with machinery in it.\" src=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexMachinery.jpg/120px-FracturedComplexMachinery.jpg?5724c5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexMachinery.jpg/180px-FracturedComplexMachinery.jpg?5724c5 1.5x, /images/thumb/FracturedComplexMachinery.jpg/240px-FracturedComplexMachinery.jpg?5724c5 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">A room with machinery in it.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:FracturedComplexConveyor.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The large room with the long conveyor belt.\"><img alt=\"The large room with the long conveyor belt.\" src=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexConveyor.jpg/120px-FracturedComplexConveyor.jpg?7a71ce\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexConveyor.jpg/180px-FracturedComplexConveyor.jpg?7a71ce 1.5x, /images/thumb/FracturedComplexConveyor.jpg/240px-FracturedComplexConveyor.jpg?7a71ce 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The large room with the long conveyor belt.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:FracturedComplexSecurityOffice.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Security Room.\"><img alt=\"The Security Room.\" src=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexSecurityOffice.jpg/120px-FracturedComplexSecurityOffice.jpg?b836d2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexSecurityOffice.jpg/180px-FracturedComplexSecurityOffice.jpg?b836d2 1.5x, /images/thumb/FracturedComplexSecurityOffice.jpg/240px-FracturedComplexSecurityOffice.jpg?b836d2 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"> The Security Room.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:FracturedComplexCatwalks.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Catwalks.\"><img alt=\"The Catwalks.\" src=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexCatwalks.jpg/120px-FracturedComplexCatwalks.jpg?507588\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexCatwalks.jpg/180px-FracturedComplexCatwalks.jpg?507588 1.5x, /images/thumb/FracturedComplexCatwalks.jpg/240px-FracturedComplexCatwalks.jpg?507588 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Catwalks.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:FracturedComplexChute.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"Scrap spawning in the Catwalks near the railing.\"><img alt=\"Scrap spawning in the Catwalks near the railing.\" src=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexChute.jpg/120px-FracturedComplexChute.jpg?71b51e\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexChute.jpg/180px-FracturedComplexChute.jpg?71b51e 1.5x, /images/thumb/FracturedComplexChute.jpg/240px-FracturedComplexChute.jpg?71b51e 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Scrap spawning in the Catwalks near the railing.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:FracturedComplexCatwalkLoot.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The loot room in the Catwalks with a staircase and several cabinets.\"><img alt=\"The loot room in the Catwalks with a staircase and several cabinets.\" src=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexCatwalkLoot.jpg/120px-FracturedComplexCatwalkLoot.jpg?139730\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexCatwalkLoot.jpg/180px-FracturedComplexCatwalkLoot.jpg?139730 1.5x, /images/thumb/FracturedComplexCatwalkLoot.jpg/240px-FracturedComplexCatwalkLoot.jpg?139730 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The loot room in the Catwalks with a staircase and several cabinets.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:FracturedComplexAppRoom.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Apparatus room.\"><img alt=\"The Apparatus room.\" src=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexAppRoom.jpg/120px-FracturedComplexAppRoom.jpg?813232\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/FracturedComplexAppRoom.jpg/180px-FracturedComplexAppRoom.jpg?813232 1.5x, /images/thumb/FracturedComplexAppRoom.jpg/240px-FracturedComplexAppRoom.jpg?813232 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Apparatus room.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: